s éjus: * et justítia éjus mánet in</l><l xml:id="m-2a5843f8-35eb-47d5-b590-9fbb75121dd2" facs="#m-4f26c1dd-39d1-4227-8609-60a9ca75cc36" label="lyrics-like">saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-2f847490-bb81-4a9d-a008-2c6e9ffccc59" facs="#m-649d3d65-9049-428d-88c8-bb82eff2716c" label="lyrics-like">4. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum, t miséricors et miserátor</l><l xml:id="m-a506d22c-9fe8-4542-8aa0-dbbebdabce84" facs="#m-e3faa335-a4aa-494d-b850-5b82063197d4" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus: * éscam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-d2bfd54d-f65f-40f9-9237-c01428224efa" facs="#m-957f1bf5-6953-4476-b967-a62b81e628c6" label="lyrics-like">5. Mémor érit in saéculum testaménti súi :* virtútem óperum suórum</l><l xml:id="m-55133cc1-f8ba-49e9-979d-083f8323f801" facs="#m-6f058fa7-b7ee-40ee-bbd2-8fcd27b02d23" label="lyrics-like">annuntiábit pópulo súo:</l><l xml:id="m-2af75e21-91b3-43ce-b3f5-5a1ab361b143" facs="#m-b2a7dde4-3d54-4e72-bd50-f800f0cafae4" label="lyrics-like">6. Ut det illis haereditâtem géntium:“opera mánuum éjus véritas</l><l xml:id="m-e9112249-84f7-4df8-ab20-3e73b92066f3" facs="#m-2837ba96-7ed7-43c4-be61-90b85748c55d" label="ambiguous">et judicium.</l><l xml:id="m-371dc481-1043-4400-b08c-37e64499f085" facs="#m-05f1bf95-4bf1-4a2b-9cde-8df05c904f6e" label="lyrics-like">7. Fidélia ómnia mandáta éjus: t confirmáta in saéculum saéculi:"</l><l xml:id="m-e5e478e5-c935-4a23-8a72-0005b74e914d" facs="#m-9b94df26-76b2-4d16-9e97-ee19749982ca" label="lyrics-like">fácta in veritáte et aequitáte.</l><l xml:id="m-87c35b86-c747-40bd-b7e3-c73cf6dfe0c8" facs="#m-c713cca4-acd7-46fc-9207-51437f2307c0" label="lyrics-like">8. Redemptiónem mísit pópulo súo: * mandávit in aetérnum testa¬</l><l xml:id="m-e437b74b-df03-4960-9ba7-e875b9a10b48" facs="#m-a8d01994-fa6a-410e-8407-e5ad1e2579a1" label="lyrics-like">méntum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-8a3da66a-418d-4a6e-adb6-3aefbdbc113a" facs="#m-e3317ac8-5de0-44ae-a9e7-7174e7a0d784" label="lyrics-like">9. Sánctum et terribile nómen éjus: * initium sapiéntiae timor</l><l xml:id="m-48df2905-74bb-4c59-8c1e-3dd16a28ee84" facs="#m-5422e524-e04b-4265-9972-e2dddacf5d36" label="lyrics-like">Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-03f302e9-bb66-49ea-bfec-4cc2333ae300" facs="#m-14a491c8-4e8c-445e-b638-0befbe2d9171" label="lyrics-like">10. Intelléctus bónus ómnibus faciéntibus éum:* laudátio éjus mánet</l><l xml:id="m-5382da4d-c383-485f-99f5-30cd72dc8e52" facs="#m-a6a6caed-d721-4a0f-bf86-570c850a01ae" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-55396ebc-5f84-416e-b1f8-a7ced8b66c18" facs="#m-0b6b93aa-af0f-4cb1-96b8-6c292f5088dc" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, *et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-1aa25a2c-4181-445f-ae28-81153160268b" facs="#m-5123a045-4c56-4a89-834e-e38705bce5df" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nûne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a173a780-af20-477b-90e0-689ce365359e" facs="#m-70bbf401-0487-4778-8ce4-a5fd4fad050a" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l></lg>
